  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kougny Onion Producers&apos; Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Onion production and marketing, Beneficiaries: 517 (244 women), Description: The project will provide support to strengthen the Union&apos;s capacities to deliver good quality services to its groups&apos; members. The focus may include construction of infrastructure including large diameter wells, compost pits, and storage facilities, irrigation equipment, and/or supply of inputs (seeds, fertilizers), as well financial administrative and leadership training, technical training and organization of marketing/ sales.</narrative>
  </description>
